_pdbx_database_remark.id     999 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE
GLUR6 S1 (RESIDUES 429-544) AND GLUR6 S2 (RESIDUES 667-806)
ARE LINKED BY A GT (RESIDUES 665, 666) PEPTIDE.
THE NATIVE GLUR-5 IS A MEMBRANE PROTEIN. THE PROTEIN
CRYSTALLIZED BY THE AUTHOR IS THE EXTRACELLULAR LIGAND
BINDING DOMAIN OF GLUR-5.  TRANSMEMBRANE REGIONS WERE
GENETICALLY REMOVED AND REPLACED WITH A GLY-THR LINKER.
THE SEQUENCE, AS A RESULT, MATCHES DISCONTINUOUSLY WITH
THE REFERENCE DATABASE
;
